{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a platform jumping game. You must avoid random spikes or traps to reach the finish line and defeat the BOSS through specific rules! The gameplay is simple and more casual!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/\u6807\u9898_logo_320x180.png?t=1739415303\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Introduction to gameplay</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Avoid enemies, avoid spikes, and avoid traps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. There are many types of Bosses, and specific rules must be used to defeat them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/boss_01.gif?t=1739415303\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Role introduction</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Move left and right, jump, accelerate sprint!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. You can sprint to avoid enemy attacks or spikes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/player_nv_walk_01.gif?t=1739415303\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Introduction to subsequent level gameplay</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. New levels will be updated regularly in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Each level will have a specific way to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. There will be various ways to defeat the final BOSS of each level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/tu3.png?t=1739415303\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519370/extras/tu.png?t=1739415303\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3519370?t=17